      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MONKEY MAGIC (1) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (22.25) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Cannington. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. ZATARA'S IMAGE (7) missed the frame last time when fourth (17.49) in a Free For All at this track after a slow start and settling well off the pace. The start before hit the ground running and won (17.49) at this track. Form at the trip sound including 13 wins. One of the better hopes. MAD HOWLER (2) ran below best last time finishing sixth (17.56) over 300m at this track from Box 5. Boasts a strong record from this draw with two wins and two minor placings from five starts. Has ability and can atone. JOLLY OLLIE (3) is worth including after a top-three finish most recently.",
